# Procedure using IF ELSE

```sql
DELIMITER $$

CREATE PROCEDURE CheckMarks
(
    IN pMarks INT
)
BEGIN

    IF pMarks >= 35 THEN

        SELECT 'PASS' AS Result;

    ELSE

        SELECT 'FAIL' AS Result;

    END IF;

END $$

DELIMITER ;
```

Execute

```sql
CALL CheckMarks(60);
```

Output

```
PASS
```

